      <pattern name="Retryable 503 for an unreadable lookup" location="tests/integration/contract/Api/ExternalAccess/ExternalAccessContractTests.cs">The invite routes' 503 contact_lookup_failed answer and its test (:822-860) — copy its assertion shape.</pattern>
      <pattern name="Status mapping by deny code" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/CallerPrincipalResolver.cs">The owner-unconfigured 500 branch (:756-770) shows a non-403 branch keyed on the deny code with reasonCode + errorCode.</pattern>
